# Scenario 1: Onboarding a six-clinic healthcare group

Simulation with a fictional customer, using Cal.com as the real product. Not paid client work.

Goal: cut no-shows from 18% to 12.6% in 90 days (simulated goal).

## What is in this folder
- documents/: success plan, kickoff deck, setup record, training materials, feedback toolkit, QBR deck
- spreadsheets/: adoption tracker and QBR plan
- images/: HubSpot and Slack screenshots